{"v":4,"catch":"他們帶來地獄。","desc":"《JACKAL》是KONAMI於1986年發行的動作遊戲。\n「Jackal」是一支能夠在任何條件下生存的特種部隊。\n控制他們並駕駛你的裝甲車進入敵方領土的中心營救囚犯。\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2024-06-27","genres":["動作","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/54fee9d8ac5a9096aa1a1caeeeab2f6bb00be1d956c542d08046178afe712ea7.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/332db69c1c8e72e0f2b3d9f56422c3a4ddf0ed85f55b57a19faeeafb2749aefd.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/bede618d7c3e73783899fb4dd2da33615295ed43814460a500bdf09bb3970ef8.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/0f8b191fb35d8462d0e8f35c46ad108f07c42a9b0659eade603e38b707c8f4f2.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/a5f1a2261e260baba8dd1e08b785fe347fb077d666ee97af1a758d82b161ee48.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/9686d938a6e8c04ddfccf65c5f89c4531be38081baec339a10fb50fb553c4c6b.jpg"],"titleId":"01001ad01f138000","dlc":[]}